<h2>You've Been Outbid</h2>

<p>Another team has submitted a higher bid for <strong><%= @player.name %></strong>.</p>

<h3>Your Bid Details:</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Player:</strong> <%= @player.name %> (<%= @player.position %>)</li>
  <li><strong>Your Team:</strong> <%= @team.name %></li>
  <li><strong>Your Annual Amount:</strong> <%= number_to_currency(@bid.annual_amount) %></li>
  <li><strong>Contract Length:</strong> <%= @bid.contract_length %> years</li>
  <li><strong>Total Value:</strong> <%= number_to_currency(@bid.total_amount) %></li>
</ul>

<p>Your bid is still active, but you'll need to submit a higher bid to win this player.</p>

<p>Log in to the bidding console to increase your offer if you want to secure this player.</p>

<p>
  <em>Billy Martin Players League</em>
</p>
